  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpixeldreamstudios.net%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/FANTASY_MINECRAFT/MP_FANTASY_MINECRAFT_Header.webp\" alt=\"\"></a>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>在開發這個整合包期間，我使用 BisectHosting 的伺服器來測試多人遊戲的相容性與效能。設定過程非常快速，伺服器也能順暢地運行該整合包，沒有任何問題。</p>\n<p>如果你正在尋找伺服器來與朋友一起玩這個整合包，我推薦使用 BisectHosting。</p>\n<p>於結帳時使用折扣碼 <strong>PIXELDREAM</strong>&nbsp;即可享有 <strong>首台遊戲伺服器 25% 折扣。</strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fPixelDream\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/FANTASY_MINECRAFT/MP_FANTASY_MINECRAFT_Promo.webp\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/FANTASY_MINECRAFT/MP_FANTASY_MINECRAFT_Description.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>我們的目標是將<strong>豐富多彩的奇幻內容</strong>融入 Minecraft，同時維持原汁原味的<strong>原版體驗</strong>。憑藉眾多<strong>效能優化模組</strong>的加持，本整合包已針對各種電腦系統進行最佳化，確保<strong>穩定流暢的運行表現</strong>。此外，我們也精心調校了所有模組的設定，力求達到<strong>無縫整合</strong>。若您也是同好（就跟我們一樣），定會樂見整合包中散落著許多向熱門奇幻影視與遊戲致敬的<strong>巧妙彩蛋與隱藏驚喜</strong>。欲了解更多資訊，歡迎自由探索<strong>維基百科</strong>。</p>\n<p>可透過社群成員製作的<a href=\"https://youtube.com/playlist?list=PLN0QC7Gx4uK72neKTJ_thPLktglRi6ZBU\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">這套影片系列</a>，全面了解所有可用的職業。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.pixeldreamstudios.net%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/FANTASY_MINECRAFT/MP_FANTASY_MINECRAFT_Discord.webp\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/FANTASY_MINECRAFT/MP_FANTASY_MINECRAFT_Showcase.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/F5G55CZCfHg\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/rBNGyzgVBn4\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/RPS5MvvUYr8\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/XJX0DIUfJ4s\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/aMsSDkVxkOI\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/IH47uKX5P_Y\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/k5UmBiYw-LY?si=iCWB9sAfbWDjhm0C\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/U2Upz1ixTTo?si=YC5dxo9d9rs2Tz8h\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/MxQLjwVJIGs?si=0PWTzJ6mQ1JnfXO3\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>",
